18</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000665-Chen2"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Ting</surname><given-names>AY</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Site-specific labeling of proteins with small molecules in live cells.</article-title><source>Curr Opin Biotechnol</source><volume>16</volume><fpage>35</fpage><lpage>40</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15722013</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000665-Ntziachristos1"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ntziachristos</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Ripoll</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>LV</given-names></name><name><surname>Weissleder</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Looking and listening to light: the evolution of whole-body photonic imaging.</article-title><source>Nat Biotechnol</source><volume>23</volume><fpage>313</fpage><lpage>320</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15765087</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000665-Weissleder1"><label>15</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Weissleder</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Ntziachristos</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Shedding light onto live molecular targets.</article-title><source>Nat Med</source><volume>9</volume><fpage>123</fpage><lpage>128</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12514725</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000665-Adams1"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Adams</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Campbell</surname><given-name